<title>UK: U-Freight Ireland offers Internet service.</title>
<headline>U-Freight Ireland offers Internet service.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based international airfreight forwarding group U-Freight says its Irish associate, U-Freight EFL, is now able to offer clients a cargo tracking service via the Internet.</p>
<p>&quot;Our customers are now able to track and trace their shipments ...and can also utilise other value-added information services,&quot; said U-Freight EFL managing director Ed Mullin.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
